From 41d6e66ce436c359bf6272d5eeff07a7f4ec85a9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: verkur46 <mohamadrezasahami1999@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 02:44:05 +0330
Subject: [PATCH 037/230] Add comment reporting and an admin moderation queue

Users can report timeline and rating comments (one per user per comment,
rate-limited); admins can list the queue, delete a comment, or hide a user's
comments. Hiding is non-destructive: hidden comments vanish from the public
reads while the rating value survives. The suite drives the whole loop and
proves a non-admin gets 403 on every admin endpoint.
